# >>> papersmith managed block: `papersmith upgrade` rewrites every line up to the closing marker
# papersmith workspace — generated files and local state
.micromamba/
.venv/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.scratch/
.env*
.papersmith/runs_ledger.jsonl
skills/paper-ingestion/.venv/
kaggle-inbox/*
!kaggle-inbox/.gitkeep

# Harness skill projections: symlinks to `skills/`, generated by
# `papersmith init`/`upgrade` and `scripts/setup-harnesses.sh`. `skills/` is
# the only versioned copy.
.claude/skills
.opencode/skills
.pi/skills
.agents/skills

# Research content: the folder travels, its contents stay home. Every entry
# here mirrors this framework's own root .gitignore — a workspace is meant to
# reach the same "structure versioned, content local" contract this repo
# holds itself to, so nobody's papers, proposals, or run products leave their
# machine by accident. `sections/` is deliberately NOT listed: it travels with
# content, like `skills/`, because the ten section contracts are generic
# writing scaffolding, not this workspace's own research.
guidance/*/*
!guidance/*/.gitkeep
proposals/*
!proposals/.gitkeep
paper/*
!paper/.gitkeep
experiments/*
!experiments/.gitkeep
implementations/*
!implementations/.gitkeep
# The plausibility flow's graph pool. It was the one entry this file claimed to
# mirror and did not carry, so a workspace committed its own run product by
# default — `atlas.html` alone inlines the whole 3D viewer bundle.
sota-pool/*
!sota-pool/.gitkeep
# Engine state beside that content. Each deliberation skill keeps its
# revisions' state, receipts and permanent locks in its own sidecar folder, and
# that state embeds and hashes the very revisions the lines above keep local:
# it is content, and committing it publishes them. The same skills move
# revisions and their sidecars to `backup/<folder>/` when reconciling a base.
.proposal-deliberation/
.experimental-deliberation/
backup/proposals/
backup/experiments/
# <<< papersmith managed block ends: lines below this marker are this workspace's own, and upgrade keeps them

# Local agent state: logs and write markers never leave this machine.
.claude/logs/
.claude/.cc-writes/
